# The OpenRouter API key is entered directly in the UI and stored in localStorage.
# No server-side secrets needed — all calls are made directly from the browser
# to https://openrouter.ai, which routes to Anthropic, OpenAI, Google and DeepSeek.
#
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys

# VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
